2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] The simplest credentials for AWS CLI on EC2 is using an IAM Instance Profile - no manual
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] credentials needed!
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] Setup IAM Role for EC2:
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] 1. Create IAM Role in AWS Console:
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat]    - Service: EC2
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat]    - Permissions: `AmazonEC2ReadOnlyAccess` (for describe-instances)
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat]    - Name: `ec2-readonly-role`
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] 2. Attach to your instance:
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat]    # In AWS Console: EC2 > Instances > Actions > Security > Modify IAM Role
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] 3. Then your command works automatically:
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat]    aws ec2 describe-instances \
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat]        --instance-ids i-0fa5f85d1ec84796c \
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat]        --query 'Reservations[].Instances[].MetadataOptions' \
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat]        --output table
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] Alternative - Minimal IAM Policy:
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] If creating the role, use this minimal policy:
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] {
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat]     "Version": "2012-10-17",
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat]     "Statement": [
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat]         {
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat]             "Effect": "Allow",
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat]             "Action": "ec2:DescribeInstances",
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat]             "Resource": "*"
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat]         }
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat]     ]
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] }
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] The IAM Instance Profile is the AWS best practice - no credentials to manage or rotate!
2025-10-01 08:11:13 [deepseek-chat] 
