2025-10-01 09:50:18 [deepseek-chat] The issue is that `node:ssh2` isn't a built-in Node.js module. You need to install the `ssh2`
2025-10-01 09:50:18 [deepseek-chat] package first:
2025-10-01 09:50:18 [deepseek-chat] 
